flowchart TB
    U[Family users] -->|Browser| CHAT["https://family.example.com/chat"]
    GPT[ChatGPT custom MCP app] -->|Streamable HTTP + OAuth| MCP["https://family.example.com/mcp"]

    subgraph EDGE["Same public origin - serverless Next.js control plane"]
        CHAT --> WEB[Next.js 15 + React 19 Chat UI]
        MCP --> MCPH["@modelcontextprotocol/server MCP handler"]
        AUTH["Better Auth\npasskey + OAuth provider + MCP + CIMD + JWT"]
        WEB --> AUTH
        MCPH --> AUTH
        API["Serverless Chat / Task API"]
        WEB --> API
        MCPH --> ROUTER[Call Router]
        API --> ROUTER
    end

    AUTH --> AUTHDB[("Durable Auth DB\nserverless SQL target")]
    ROUTER --> JAZZ["Jazz application database / sync"]

    subgraph JSTATE["Jazz durable shared state"]
        DEV[(devices)]
        CALLS[(remoteCalls)]
        AUDIT[(auditEvents)]
        GRANTS[("proposed: familyMemberships / deviceGrants")]
        CONV[("proposed: conversations")]
        MSG[("proposed: messages")]
        LEASE[("proposed: agentSessions / 25m lease")]
    end
    JAZZ --> DEV
    JAZZ --> CALLS
    JAZZ --> AUDIT
    JAZZ --> GRANTS
    JAZZ --> CONV
    JAZZ --> MSG
    JAZZ --> LEASE

    API -->|create conversation/message| CONV
    API -->|enqueue execution task| CALLS
    MCPH -->|MCP tool request -> durable call| CALLS
    API -->|create or refresh 25m session lease| LEASE
    WEB <-->|realtime sync or bounded polling| MSG
    CALLS -->|completed result reference| MSG
    GRANTS -.->|authorize family member to shared laptop| ROUTER

    subgraph HOME["Home laptop - long-lived worker"]
        DEVICE[MCPDevice]
        TOKEN["DeviceTokenManager + NativeCredentialStore"]
        CHANNEL["RemoteChannel\nJazz subscription + heartbeat + reconnect"]
        CLAIM["HttpDeviceControlPlaneClient\nclaim / complete"]
        BRIDGE[DesktopCommanderIntegration]
        SDK["MCP Client + StdioClientTransport"]
        DC["Existing Desktop Commander stdio MCP"]
        OS["Filesystem / terminal / local apps"]
    end
    DEVICE --> TOKEN
    DEVICE --> CHANNEL
    CHANNEL <-->|read pending calls| CALLS
    DEVICE --> CLAIM
    CLAIM -->|server-mediated claim| ROUTER
    CLAIM -->|durable completion| ROUTER
    DEVICE --> BRIDGE
    BRIDGE --> SDK
    SDK --> DC
    DC --> OS

    LEASE -.->|authorizes active family work window| ROUTER
    DEV -.->|device identity and online state| ROUTER
    ROUTER --> AUDIT

    NOTE1["Do not keep a serverless HTTP request open for 25 minutes"]
    LEASE -.-> NOTE1
    NOTE2["Laptop worker may stay connected continuously; 25m is an application lease"]
    DEVICE -.-> NOTE2
    NOTE3["Same origin: /mcp for ChatGPT, /chat for family UI, /api/auth for Better Auth"]
    EDGE -.-> NOTE3
    NOTE4["Current node:sqlite auth DB is not serverless-safe; use durable external SQL"]
    AUTHDB -.-> NOTE4
    NOTE5["Current ownerId authorization must be extended for family sharing"]
    GRANTS -.-> NOTE5
